    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392810/extras/84632f8f9afa408f56cfba055679ddd2.avif?t=1747498041\" data-has-big /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;Wound Man's Lacerated Legacy&quot; is the latest content expansion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continue your macabre adventure by carving your path through Wound Man\u2019s darkest challenges yet.\u00a0 &quot;Wound Man\u2019s Lacerated Legacy&quot; is packed with thrilling new content that will test your wits and reward your curiosity.  Can you uncover the 20 hidden truths that unlock Wound Man\u2019s fate? Only the most curious and courageous players will rise to the challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20 New Secrets to Discover:</strong> Unlock hidden paths and mysteries to trigger mini-games, mini-puzzles, and the unfolding storyline.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Storyline of Consequences:</strong> Your choices will shape Wound Man\u2019s journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Treasures for the Cabinet of Curiosity:</strong>  Add rare wonders to your growing collection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Steam Achievements:</strong> Prove your mastery and unlock exclusive accolades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Music:</strong> Enhance your journey with haunting melodies and immersive soundscapes tailored to Wound Man\u2019s world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392810/extras/07460eec7648e9fe590b76853ff3a890.avif?t=1747498041\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;Wound Man's Corporeal Quest&quot; is Wound Man's first content expansion.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic adventure as you search each puzzle for scattered pieces of Wound Man's corporeal being. Your mission? Piece them together to restore Wound Man to full power, unlocking the key to future planned quests!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 secrets to find which include new mini games (2) and mini puzzles (8).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret collection - An area to collect found secret items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New achievements (6)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rewards for completing secret quests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More critters to find for your Cabinet of Curiosity. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wound Man is a Macabre Jigsaw Puzzle Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together fascinating, historical images and uncover Wound Man's story.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring fascinating centuries-old artwork from some of the worlds most famous anatomical artists.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first major content update has arrived!  This version introduces Wound Man's Corporeal Quest.  Wound Man's body has been hewn in pieces and scattered throughout the levels.  Search each puzzle for bits of Wound Man's corporeal being, then piece them together to bring him back to full power.  The power needed for achieving future planned quests.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392810/extras/ae3d2da3354fa7ed9448de8d54124592.poster.avif?t=1747498041\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392810/extras/ae3d2da3354fa7ed9448de8d54124592.webm?t=1747498041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392810/extras/ae3d2da3354fa7ed9448de8d54124592.mp4?t=1747498041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 30 puzzles, with three different levels of difficulty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Over 1000 unique puzzle pieces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Original soundtrack with over 20 tracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Secrets to discover within every puzzle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392810/extras/6c6bc786c28697ae2eb9693d2d86ff24.poster.avif?t=1747498041\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392810/extras/6c6bc786c28697ae2eb9693d2d86ff24.webm?t=1747498041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392810/extras/6c6bc786c28697ae2eb9693d2d86ff24.mp4?t=1747498041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>There are different modes for different types of players:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Casual mode is intended for players who want to sit back, relax and enjoy the grotesque images and intriguing story line. (~1-2 hours or gameplay)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Challenge mode is for players who want to dive deeper into the images and spend more time recreating the artwork.  (~2-3 hours of gameplay)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Special mode is intended to provided endless replayability with features like random distribution of pieces, game timers and other unique puzzles. (~2-3+ hours of gameplay)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Story so far...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Wound Man is a tulpa, brought into existence by humanity\u2019s thoughts. He has persisted for centuries as the embodiment of medical drawings crafted throughout the ages. Initially formed by master anatomists to bestow vital information upon medics, healers, and surgeons, he has become the soul of all nameless medical diagrams of the male form.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His is a tale of woe - poked, shot, stabbed, dissected. He has provided us an indispensable service, but at what cost? There was a time when he could set aside the horror of his circumstance and find comfort in his plight\u2026 because of her love.  She was a salve to his open wounds.  Alas, his love, once a tulpa herself, has slipped from existence due to the creeping obscurity of her artwork.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wound Man needs your help. You can revive his lost eternal partner with your thoughts. He is counting on your help to collect pieces of her soul and restore her to her former state.&quot;</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392810/extras/84632f8f9afa408f56cfba055679ddd2.avif?t=1747498041\" data-has-big /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;Wound Man's Lacerated Legacy&quot; is the latest content expansion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continue your macabre adventure by carving your path through Wound Man\u2019s darkest challenges yet.\u00a0 &quot;Wound Man\u2019s Lacerated Legacy&quot; is packed with thrilling new content that will test your wits and reward your curiosity.  Can you uncover the 20 hidden truths that unlock Wound Man\u2019s fate? Only the most curious and courageous players will rise to the challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20 New Secrets to Discover:</strong> Unlock hidden paths and mysteries to trigger mini-games, mini-puzzles, and the unfolding storyline.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Storyline of Consequences:</strong> Your choices will shape Wound Man\u2019s journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Treasures for the Cabinet of Curiosity:</strong>  Add rare wonders to your growing collection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Steam Achievements:</strong> Prove your mastery and unlock exclusive accolades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Music:</strong> Enhance your journey with haunting melodies and immersive soundscapes tailored to Wound Man\u2019s world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392810/extras/07460eec7648e9fe590b76853ff3a890.avif?t=1747498041\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;Wound Man's Corporeal Quest&quot; is Wound Man's first content expansion.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic adventure as you search each puzzle for scattered pieces of Wound Man's corporeal being. Your mission? Piece them together to restore Wound Man to full power, unlocking the key to future planned quests!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 secrets to find which include new mini games (2) and mini puzzles (8).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret collection - An area to collect found secret items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New achievements (6)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rewards for completing secret quests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More critters to find for your Cabinet of Curiosity. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wound Man is a Macabre Jigsaw Puzzle Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together fascinating, historical images and uncover Wound Man's story.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring fascinating centuries-old artwork from some of the worlds most famous anatomical artists.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first major content update has arrived!  This version introduces Wound Man's Corporeal Quest.  Wound Man's body has been hewn in pieces and scattered throughout the levels.  Search each puzzle for bits of Wound Man's corporeal being, then piece them together to bring him back to full power.  The power needed for achieving future planned quests.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392810/extras/ae3d2da3354fa7ed9448de8d54124592.poster.avif?t=1747498041\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392810/extras/ae3d2da3354fa7ed9448de8d54124592.webm?t=1747498041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392810/extras/ae3d2da3354fa7ed9448de8d54124592.mp4?t=1747498041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 30 puzzles, with three different levels of difficulty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Over 1000 unique puzzle pieces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Original soundtrack with over 20 tracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Secrets to discover within every puzzle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392810/extras/6c6bc786c28697ae2eb9693d2d86ff24.poster.avif?t=1747498041\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392810/extras/6c6bc786c28697ae2eb9693d2d86ff24.webm?t=1747498041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2392810/extras/6c6bc786c28697ae2eb9693d2d86ff24.mp4?t=1747498041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>There are different modes for different types of players:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Casual mode is intended for players who want to sit back, relax and enjoy the grotesque images and intriguing story line. (~1-2 hours or gameplay)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Challenge mode is for players who want to dive deeper into the images and spend more time recreating the artwork.  (~2-3 hours of gameplay)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Special mode is intended to provided endless replayability with features like random distribution of pieces, game timers and other unique puzzles. (~2-3+ hours of gameplay)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Story so far...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Wound Man is a tulpa, brought into existence by humanity\u2019s thoughts. He has persisted for centuries as the embodiment of medical drawings crafted throughout the ages. Initially formed by master anatomists to bestow vital information upon medics, healers, and surgeons, he has become the soul of all nameless medical diagrams of the male form.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His is a tale of woe - poked, shot, stabbed, dissected. He has provided us an indispensable service, but at what cost? There was a time when he could set aside the horror of his circumstance and find comfort in his plight\u2026 because of her love.  She was a salve to his open wounds.  Alas, his love, once a tulpa herself, has slipped from existence due to the creeping obscurity of her artwork.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wound Man needs your help. You can revive his lost eternal partner with your thoughts. He is counting on your help to collect pieces of her soul and restore her to her former state.&quot;</p>",
